Subject: [PATCH 8/9] a5xx: prepare public installer and docs

Make the install/test scripts public-friendly: explicit user@host, SSH keys, passwordless sudo, logs and backups under $HOME.  Add the root README and document the WIP/upstream status.  No device-specific credentials remain in the tree.

Signed-off-by: Kulesha Evgeniy <voovdop@gmail.com>
